			"width": 400,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "## Data Flow\n\n```\nJTBD\n  └── linkedIdeas[]\n        └── Ideas\n              └── (filtered from)\n                    Requirements.linkedIdeas[]\n```\n\n**Note:** Requirements have `linkedIdeas[]`"
		},
		{
			"id": "status-badges",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Status Badges\n\n- `ft-status-badge-covered` 🟢\n- `ft-status-badge-partial` 🟡\n- `ft-status-badge-gap` 🔴\n- `ft-status-badge-orphan` ⚪"
		},
		{
			"id": "events-node",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 180,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1",
			"text": "## Event Subscriptions\n\n- `solution.*` → refreshData()\n- `idea.*` → refreshData()\n- `requirement.*` → refreshData()\n- `jtbd.*` → refreshData()"
		},
		{
			"id": "traceability-logic",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## Traceability Logic\n\n**buildTraceabilityRows():**\n\n1. For each JTBD:\n   - Find linked Ideas\n   - Find Reqs linked to Ideas\n   - Determine status\n\n2. Add orphan Ideas (no JTBD link)\n\n3. Add orphan Requirements (no linkedIdeas)"
		}
